Z||000000||curtis||01-31-2000||12:02 AM||||Well I bought my 86 GT a month ago and Friday night I truly fell in love with it. My previous car was a 94 Eclipse(I know I drove a rice burner myself) and on my way to the video store on a long stretch of road from behind comes a 99 Eclipse GS. As he starts to pass he looks over and decides he wants to play so he keeps speeding up and hitting his brakes. After about 3 times I get tired of it and at about 60 I down shift to third and blow his doors off. after a few minutes he catches up again and obviously didn't learn his lesson. So I left him behind for good this time. It was so much fun.||||reg||10
